@startuml
' Added by the "Add Example Page" task for the IG Features page.
' Becomes the include ig-features-sequence.svg during the build.
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
participant "Client" as C
participant "Server" as S
C -> S: GET __EXAMPLE_TYPE__/__EXAMPLE_ID__
activate S
S --> C: 200 OK, the __EXAMPLE_TYPE__
deactivate S
note over C, S: Each arrow points from the caller to the one being called.
@enduml
